        "values": {
          "en": "The **fundamental group** $\\pi_1(X,x_0)$ is the set of homotopy classes of loops in $X$ based at $x_0$, with the product $[f][g]=[f\\cdot g]$. It is a group (Hatcher Proposition 1.3, p. 26).",
